cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite this archived version."
title: "Fully anonymous threshold-three secret sharing with logarithmic overhead"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For n participants and threshold three, gives perfect honest-party fully anonymous secret sharing of an L-bit secret with L+O(log n) bits per share, exact anonymity for pairs and zero-error recovery from three unlabeled shares. No claim about larger thresholds or active robustness."
